{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "c445dd1f1235cbaa5da4b3c8862ec9973c72be9092c8cc83df81ce8665a29ae7", "ja": "機兵群の襲撃により、否応なく戦闘に突入す\nるガーデン。ミキとシホが奮戦するものの\n包囲を突破できず、全滅の危機に瀕するが、\n潜在能力を発動させたイクの干渉により\n全機兵が停止。戦闘は終結したのだった。", "zh": "由于机兵群的袭击，花园不得不投入战斗。\n美希和志保奋勇作战，却无法突破包围，濒临全灭危机。\n但在育发动潜在能力的干涉下，所有机兵都停止了行动。\n战斗就此结束。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_05_1000_033sih", "source_sha256": "80ea9c6695b75e2319d3d2b32310782e62fe0cb3a51fcd53a607d1eb3aff3db4", "ja": "エミリー？　うそ、ダメよ、エミリー！\nどこにいるの、ねぇ！　応えて……、いかないで！！", "zh": "爱丽米莉？不，不行，爱丽米莉！\n你在哪里，喂！回答我……不要走！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_05_1001_027say", "source_sha256": "73974ecdd215c2980f8b9dbe1128602c09fe1e289da6db236e7ea49ae016d229", "ja": "シホ！　落ち着いて、しっかりするの！\nエミリーはまだMIA、行方不明なだけ！", "zh": "志保！冷静点，振作起来！艾米莉还只是MIA，只是下落不明而已！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_05_1002_027say", "source_sha256": "9f387dd3cf79f4a979839ac036d2b8f3462da3e9a1b4cc3eb17dfca7b88771bf", "ja": "それより第二波が来る、今は……、危ない！！", "zh": "比起那个，第二波要来了，现在……危险！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_05_1003_se", "source_sha256": "99922f04f36edd94285a3e86f17a0362df876825d85ff0e40f6dbc8f02806ae5", "ja": "ガガーーーーーン！！\nズガガガガーーーーーーン！！！！", "zh": "嘎嘎——————！！\n轰隆隆隆——————！！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_05_1004_003mik", "source_sha256": "e3f6456133e9063ef9e1494f560f658e95b071124b538a4791d65ba68b52c2e0", "ja": "また……まただ……。\nどうして……どうして、どうして、どうして！！", "zh": "又……又是这样……\n为什么……为什么，为什么，为什么啊！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_05_1005_003mik", "source_sha256": "0d286bfed31288753acd5af3b273794e990c468f5cbfea7386770ff68a867f1b", "ja": "もういい。わかったの。1万でも10万でも、\n全部、全部、全部！！　たたき壊すからッ！！", "zh": "算了。美希懂了。不管是1万还是10万，\n全都要、全都要、全都要！！通通砸个粉碎！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_05_1006_027say", "source_sha256": "77b0caecf5fe962023eade37573a9045b4c46ca56b1d7b5a17cf091f318f2aaf", "ja": "ミキ！！　待って、待ちなさい！！", "zh": "美希！！等一下，快住手！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_05_1007_033sih", "source_sha256": "80fc8f94efbe0d85bad56393e8eb47325d3de609d1d303a2f9d89df52d3d53bf", "ja": "！？　……先輩っ！？", "zh": "！？……前辈！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_05_1008_se", "source_sha256": "0a6c33d5caca52a086e939a72254e16b4d239f821f09393e474fa734a1779702", "ja": "ガンッ！　ガンガンッ、ギィン！　ガインッ！", "zh": "砰！砰砰、锵！锵！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_05_1009_003mik", "source_sha256": "b531a48e8b2a141524287d127f174c606303d70051e1fb3b3a836ace60f49077", "ja": "このっ、このっ、このぉぉぉ！\n墜ちろ！　墜ちろ！　墜ちろ墜ちろーーーっ！！", "zh": "接招！接招！接招啊啊啊！\n给我掉下去！给我掉下去！给我掉下去掉下去——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_05_1010_se", "source_sha256": "5cba5267baaf3fa6569f7f060f8845cf127458cc12c0f358ab2887ee3233629f", "ja": "ガンガンガンッ！　ブゥンッ！！　ガキィィィン！！", "zh": "咣咣咣！　嗡——！！　锵——！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_05_1011_003mik", "source_sha256": "0a8a9b05f6eb9ec8f2723797682b48a4c17b1463da754927f83a462e17628aaf", "ja": "何も知らないくせに！　何もいらないくせに！\n怒り、憎しみ、破壊！　それしかないくせに！！", "zh": "明明什么都不知道！明明什么都不需要！\n愤怒、憎恨、破坏！明明就只剩下这些！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_05_1012_se", "source_sha256": "8139d7319aa4ec41041583e0bd43cef86c71d0993ddf6718cded2e90790b9f27", "ja": "ズガガーン！！　ブンブンッ、ギィン、ガィン！！", "zh": "轰隆隆！！　嗡嗡、锵、铛！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_05_1013_003mik", "source_sha256": "c44f167e1676d6256b078f58b8f46fd5be38175431127b79cb0a39605c5fe4c0", "ja": "ただ世界を壊して！！　空っぽになるまで！！\nなんにもなくなるまで、全部壊れるまで！！", "zh": "就这样摧毁世界！！直到变得空空荡荡为止！！\n直到什么都不剩，直到全部毁灭为止！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_05_1014_se", "source_sha256": "74116b73c0d972ee36b33fbe5dca22de40aa49d7267d93e6b44b440487fe7776", "ja": "ガガッ、ズガーンッ！　ガガーンッ！　ギィン！！", "zh": "咔咔、轰——！　轰隆——！　铿！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_05_1015_003mik", "source_sha256": "03d4a45ad04fc24e9f3fe5d1851b42e602e0b6c8ead34a1bf4f3564344b1b05f", "ja": "知ってる！！　ミキ、知ってるから！！\nだって！！", "zh": "我知道！！小美希知道的！！\n因为！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_05_1016_003mik", "source_sha256": "06c08d5534304508d20a118ed6580ad01079b8aa830fa9035d3b82f1513795e5", "ja": "「機兵は全部、ミキが壊すから」", "zh": "“机兵全都会由美希来破坏”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_05_1017_003mik", "source_sha256": "8539f3a40b11d4d47634cbab45d1211e74decfe31629e4720e7474149e0c57fa", "ja": "ほら。ミキとおんなじ。", "zh": "看吧。和美希一模一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_05_1018_003mik", "source_sha256": "64fb32ba80fa16d6e8dfddb50973c2668cb516c4ab137f48b52e8673088a5703", "ja": "オンナジ　バケモノ　ダカラ……", "zh": "因为是同样的怪物……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_05_1020_033sih", "source_sha256": "6a45182d971459b40b662ee1d11c8734dc6d563a02de141f25b63db3c6e0cc25", "ja": "先輩っ！！", "zh": "前辈！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_05_1021_se", "source_sha256": "0a3b1bbb65c0c0760242342cd5cdf964ce33cd38d5cdb88235b12066ba7e9725", "ja": "ズガガガガガーーーーーン！！", "zh": "轰隆隆隆隆——！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_05_1022_003mik", "source_sha256": "3203b39243eea06fb917c0451d266cf120b60c73fc812c90009ed70798fc63d6", "ja": "あ……。シホ？", "zh": "啊……志保？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_05_1023_033sih", "source_sha256": "1f9a71f19daf2fe6da7d332e375595f7ca9e0b6d381f28d49545c22b3a583ea4", "ja": "敵中にひとりでつっこんだ挙句、ボーッとして！\nわざわざ死にに来たんですか！！", "zh": "一个人冲进敌阵也就算了，居然还发起呆来！\n你是特地跑来送死的吗！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_05_1024_033sih", "source_sha256": "64b1ac5ed70f19a98ea97a548990d500b9d606d7d9890dce83667ef1fb94067e", "ja": "せっかく……エミリーが解き放ってくれた命なのに！！\n無駄にしたら、ぶっ飛ばしますよ！？", "zh": "好不容易……这是艾米莉让你重获自由的生命啊！！要是你敢白白浪费，我就揍飞你哦！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_05_1025_003mik", "source_sha256": "5b2e2c0791b9a7a3b3ebdb4fbccacf839469232216d9a21dbf4dd5349f7979a9", "ja": "ご、ごめん。……でも大丈夫だったでしょ？\nミキ、わりとホンキで強いし。", "zh": "对、对不起。……不过没出什么事吧？\n美希其实还是很认真地很强的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_05_1026_033sih", "source_sha256": "74431340477701e983e25b5fb8be8713f79d92f097f6f6266085d1de589086fa", "ja": "強くないでしょ！！\nいつも命を削って戦って、心も体もボロボロになって！", "zh": "哪里强了！！\n总是拼了命在战斗，身心都弄得伤痕累累！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_05_1027_033sih", "source_sha256": "af70e6d81d13a0b4e036ebdf71021526543b5fa9fc7a461a7876f45e517161b4", "ja": "今、やっとわかりました。\n先輩はただ……。泣いてるだけじゃないですか。", "zh": "我现在终于明白了。\n前辈只是在……哭泣而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_05_1028_003mik", "source_sha256": "3a2b4a93ebaf80793059b1d1ef9a61ec9af41a432858616959a3f755dc471d15", "ja": "ミキが……泣いて……。", "zh": "美希……哭了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_05_1029_003mik", "source_sha256": "d7edb9c53af5fffb3d5602b586838342e1df7cceb1cc33d5e83adf0cdb916f3f", "ja": "……あのね。ミキ、約束したの。\n絶対に、止まらないって。", "zh": "……我说啊。美希和人做过约定的。\n绝对，不会停下脚步。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_05_1030_003mik", "source_sha256": "2efcaf7289490fb5f1f4614f969038b4cfcd4902ea437bdab9c0b4d9e72d484a", "ja": "止まったら、終わらないから。\n……終わらせたいから。", "zh": "停下来的话，就永远无法结束了。\n……因为美希想要做个了结。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_05_1031_027say", "source_sha256": "80cc61fa1264aa5593c705e0952c7f3d5e38337e5b8ef7805652c6c81e2c75e7", "ja": "ミキ！　まだ生きてる？", "zh": "美希！还活着吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_05_1032_003mik", "source_sha256": "f0cb0588400c669f4a3eb5c2f75dd18c49c1e0565fb0191ed006e81f3405f72a", "ja": "サヨコ！　そっちは平気？", "zh": "纱代子！你那边还好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_05_1033_027say", "source_sha256": "858782f28f63385a0ba255a1217185c15283daf01e145e862104b8028df40026", "ja": "うん、でも完全に包囲された。どこかに突破口を開く\nしかないと思う。シホと一緒に、一方向に畳みかけて！", "zh": "嗯，但是已经被彻底包围了。我觉得只能想办法打开\n一个突破口了。和志保一起，集中攻向同一个方向！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_05_1034_003mik", "source_sha256": "5daa9df197083474fefb727e0ac5b2d51fdb8bca74ece21cb5f4e2eeda8548fe", "ja": "突破口って。\nそんなの開いても、すぐ埋められるよ？", "zh": "你说突破口啊。就算打开了那种东西，也会马上被堵上的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_05_1035_027say", "source_sha256": "9188b9631d616e5dd4a23cd1d0bd55ee489e520e296a5d6966b5f58fde30cb30", "ja": "そしたらまた開いて！\nわりとホンキで強いなら、やってみせて。", "zh": "那就再打开！\n如果你真的强得有两下子，就证明给我看。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_05_1036_027say", "source_sha256": "2c085645b7730b8053675ce253e76bf59e454817549278aa5172b15b8d6a0656", "ja": "今日からは……生きるために戦いなさい！！", "zh": "从今天起……为了生存而战吧！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_05_1037_003mik", "source_sha256": "b76c2f7e60bea48a761bc183c260dca953776fab18e1cc813b42893f0615101f", "ja": "サヨコ……。", "zh": "纱代子……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_05_1038_033sih", "source_sha256": "7d50089dd6aa490388eb6281e9ea250c90f9be78e45f62e870a029c7e6d94024", "ja": "！？　包囲外周の機兵の様子がおかしい……。\nサヨコさん、確認お願いします！", "zh": "！？包围圈外围的机兵情况不对……\n佐代子小姐，请确认！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_05_1039_027say", "source_sha256": "863ef500d2034ca6be9f44759ef0f724e5e14ed533e26046226817fdbcc29839", "ja": "！！　包囲外周に超高圧縮光学エネルギー反応！\nこれは……全機レーザーに換装したの！？", "zh": "！！包围圈外围出现超高压缩光学能量反应！\n难道……所有机兵都换装成激光武器了！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_05_1040_033sih", "source_sha256": "0cb4a5cad8cc4179ab3a760f74ee93d0f41508314f7a46bceab8bf8bfbcc7587", "ja": "そうか……いま距離を取って囲んでるのは、\n近接戦闘を避けたわけじゃなくて……。", "zh": "原来如此……现在拉开距离包围我们，\n不是为了避开近身战，而是……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_05_1041_027say", "source_sha256": "bf8599886b18006c4f6680f45e1d9f6145b140f41dfd62974550d01799ecfa6f", "ja": "全機での超火力一斉飽和攻撃！？\nそんなの……エリア一帯が蒸発する！！", "zh": "全机体的超高火力饱和式齐射！？  \n那样的话……整片区域都会被蒸发掉的！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_05_1042_003mik", "source_sha256": "c034d63dc75aa467e98c8c38267c78bd3c29967d995eb15893d1e4965873fdcf", "ja": "サヨコ！　イクを連れ出して！\nお願い……生きてーーーーーっ！！！！", "zh": "纱代子！把育带出去！\n拜托……活下去——！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_05_1043_027say", "source_sha256": "2689ff6010bb2dc43a7ab2f3288bd3274d57636e22438734deb4e941292263ce", "ja": "ダメ！　エネルギー反応、臨界突破！\nイク、こっちに……えっ！？　きゃああっっ！！！！", "zh": "不行！能量反应突破临界值了！\n育，到这边来……诶！？呀啊啊啊！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_05_1044_se", "source_sha256": "e7a9e649649f3e104e14f7d59abd97cd420f7d4d08fb6b7ce937f67f3e283e9b", "ja": "カッ！！", "zh": "咔！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_05_1045_030iku", "source_sha256": "44fc64631fc3b7a749cb21a668521474c15cfa5627c3f41a857eea79d78bb40c", "ja": "（わたしが　みんなを……）", "zh": "（我……大家……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_05_1046_003mik", "source_sha256": "1a195322d9c464690d75f06ccd74f228362e899293dcfe05ae27e573e1cefdd5", "ja": "え……？　イク……？", "zh": "咦……？要走……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_05_1047_033sih", "source_sha256": "0e4b838ddad7efb0df868d5b034028e4b6299166905ca29279f3924d51a55c68", "ja": "あなた……、まさか……！！", "zh": "你……难道……！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_05_1049_null", "source_sha256": "b221411396e1e25626a9718556b4925ae21ccb739186832ecb3835eabbb2ba80", "ja": "―1ヶ月後―", "zh": "―1个月后―", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_05_1050_null", "source_sha256": "125106c6e1c30e0710b5f2d60f3d3ac3b2c0de1a5ce58bdf099c776e9e000e42", "ja": "月軌道　人工居留施設『フロンティア2』\n軌道エレベータ施設", "zh": "月球轨道　人工居留设施『Frontier2』\n轨道电梯设施", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_05_1052_027say", "source_sha256": "47f56f94eed29268af6ae5b5d835f79b7b440cb82a252ee107eecbf7eee4463d", "ja": "ミキ、お待たせ。そろそろ出発しましょうか。\n……きっと、イクが待ってるから。", "zh": "美希，让你久等了。差不多该出发了吧。\n……育一定在等着我们呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_05_1053_003mik", "source_sha256": "3da0a0ec49c18172444d468a43259366aaa4e88bd916d94e3652b54ce3611c44", "ja": "うん。\nこないだ、ちょっと笑ってくれたもんね。", "zh": "嗯。前几天，她还对我笑了一下呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_05_1054_027say", "source_sha256": "38d08aafcec9dbe2809d31e2aca89dd59c194fcf35b8e3c033df087de0b42b85", "ja": "ふふっ、私には眠ったままに見えたけど。\nミキが感じたのなら、そうなのかな。", "zh": "呵呵，不过在我看来，你当时好像还在睡觉呢。\n既然美希感觉到了，应该就是那样吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_05_1055_003mik", "source_sha256": "65f7601b5418e95e3603c84a1ec21f6f04b682aa31c00ad104d02ec60e5e6efe", "ja": "絶対そうなの。\nミキには、わかるから。", "zh": "绝对是那样的。因为美希明白。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_05_1056_003mik", "source_sha256": "8e7d3eed8e82abf4f407d835f605c05f8c5879445432d1e60b49397a1ec65855", "ja": "……『ブライト・キャンセラー』。\nまだ、再現できてないんでしょ？", "zh": "……“Bright Canceller”。\n你们还没能重现出来吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_05_1057_027say", "source_sha256": "ce06bcf04e8d2e6542dd0abdf53945c58d3f6768848081f582752e833fba46ab", "ja": "うん。人間が機兵と完全同期しての意識操作。\n数万人で一斉同期して全機兵の停止を図る……。", "zh": "嗯。人类与机兵完全同步后的意识操作。\n企图让数万人同时同步，使全部机兵停止运作……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_05_1058_027say", "source_sha256": "3375bb7295bde1694a343d442fea19bc68bef6085f5d3a1510cef991e7777309", "ja": "イクの適合性を拡張した、本当の目的。\nサスペンドパルスは、その副産物に過ぎなかった……。", "zh": "真正的目的，是扩展育的适配性。  \n暂停脉冲不过是副产品罢了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_05_1059_027say", "source_sha256": "a13c662eccdc32ab540e6d96a53a0b8a1e96f035b4d7c159732c1225fda19753", "ja": "荒唐無稽な空論のはずが、あの時イクが発動させて。\nそれから中央も……どの勢力も本気になってるけど。", "zh": "本该只是荒诞无稽的空想，却在那时被育启动了。\n从那以后，连中央……各方势力也都认真起来了，不过。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_05_1060_003mik", "source_sha256": "d3926b8445d2899c880f32d03abdd050e34533726789d79e7d6e52b4bb9391e6", "ja": "きっと、もう再現できないって思うな。\nあれはたぶん……あの時の、イクの意志だから。", "zh": "我觉得，肯定已经无法再现了。\n因为那大概是……育在那一刻的意志。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_05_1061_003mik", "source_sha256": "f15f03b41a4ba631bac1ff49dae915abfbbdd6f9d79ebf0168fc5305be6d6b27", "ja": "生きたい、絶対守りたいって思った、あの時の……。", "zh": "那时，我想着一定要活下去，一定要守护好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_05_1062_027say", "source_sha256": "9c7338e424ee36fb594894ff3628e3a7cef792d72ebe0f04a4fddbfdaf44cd97", "ja": "うん……。そうかもね。\nイクが目を覚ましたら、聞いてみましょう。", "zh": "嗯……也许吧。\n等育醒来后，我们问问她吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_05_1063_003mik", "source_sha256": "cb5f3bebac03b5eae18543713b1117f33bfba2c50eccc696ad2b6ec2c8b0b186", "ja": "うん。あと、今日はシホのお迎えにも行かなきゃね。\n査問委員会、やっと終わったんだし。", "zh": "嗯。而且今天还得去接志保呢。\n毕竟质询委员会总算结束了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_05_1064_027say", "source_sha256": "a9f278f6badc899976f72daf07061cb412b776de6d61b4ac13f66bcf130d39b7", "ja": "まだ情報を引き出せると踏んでもらえるなんて。\n……ホント、優秀な副隊長なんだから。", "zh": "居然还觉得我能继续套出情报来。  \n……真是个优秀的副队长啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_05_1065_003mik", "source_sha256": "50c075ba2d2d1370181173a2eab4e443c667fe835ba248c7c71363e7da2b2eb5", "ja": "じゃあ、早く合流するの！\nきっと……、エミリーも待ってるから。", "zh": "那就快点集合吧！\n因为……艾米莉一定也在等着我们。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_05_1066_027say", "source_sha256": "5ec6e434e3f8c3306dbec7c5a7376d40216d4f828fda7e35eede6ea39e06da3e", "ja": "……うん。……行こう！", "zh": "……嗯。……我们走吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_05_1067_027say", "source_sha256": "ada4f2849423d7b46810c5b8907fd91cac6eaa55c0a7a3fe05ec12267dd33eda", "ja": "テンタクルスの降下作戦『ダウンバースト』は、\n離反した全機兵群の一斉停止という結末で幕を閉じた。", "zh": "坦特克鲁斯的降下作战“下击暴流”，\n以所有倒戈机兵群同时停止这一结局落下了帷幕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_05_1068_027say", "source_sha256": "52b142ecea446559bb4864223a246168760bce8c07bada7e519f213bbf4ec3b6", "ja": "イク・セントラルバレイによるブライト・キャンセラー\nの発動は、人類に新たな希望をもたらしたものの……", "zh": "由中谷育发动的“光辉抵消器”虽然给人类带来了新的希望……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_05_1069_027say", "source_sha256": "e6f5378dd6d1e36a022dddf6e18e317ab9f9e94a906808b9347889f6130168c5", "ja": "イク本人は意識を回復しないまま眠り続け、\nその後の検証・解明は進んでいない。", "zh": "伊库本人一直昏睡不醒，后续的验证与调查也没有进展。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_05_1070_027say", "source_sha256": "422c4c2e636874a544a01dfb25a401ae8d4054672a821b0c3ca6932055b2f285", "ja": "逮捕拘束されたシホ・ノーマンは、査問委員会での\n情報取引により、監視を条件に原隊復帰を認められた。", "zh": "被捕并拘押的志保·诺曼通过在审查委员会进行情报交易，在接受监视的条件下获准回归原部队。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_05_1071_027say", "source_sha256": "743206f34a0973b0676b448daa06ff168a8338b54c9c487e42636d85dbc01191", "ja": "エミリー・バトラーの機体は、まだ見つかっていない。\nだがミキが存在を感じる限り……私は信じ続ける。", "zh": "艾米莉·巴特勒的机体还没有找到。\n但是，只要美希还能感受到她的存在……我就会一直相信。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_05_1072_027say", "source_sha256": "7392c9d3702baebada58f8b45bfb0d09c34d48bd09f381250fd1e6d11abe55f6", "ja": "私の名はサヨコ・ハイランド。\n戦いに終わりはなく、世界はまだ争いに満ちている。", "zh": "我的名字是萨代子·海兰德。\n战斗永无止境，世界依然充满纷争。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_05_1073_027say", "source_sha256": "c4684fc23b005e394b77f5a2ef6355371614498609cbc63d3624ae653606c8b7", "ja": "けれど希望の光はまだ失われていない。\n人は、人を想うことができるのだから。", "zh": "但是，希望之光还没有消失。\n因为人类依然能够心怀他人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0363_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_05_1074_null", "source_sha256": "0542077f6eead3dee7074fdfd57f907b51576d5d8c5cc5b53874e4d849794f94", "ja": "■テキスト表示なし■", "zh": "■不显示文本■", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
